OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers grieving over bluetongue
OL,4,Aurged to talk
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "Talking to some of the guys
OL,7,Fwho've been going out picking up large
OL,8,Fnumbers of dead animals every morning,
OL,9,Fsome of these guys I'm sure there's
OL,10,Fgoing to be a lasting impact on them."
